DataAlign|ADC_DATAALIGN_LEFT|Left alignment
ScanConvMode|ADC_SCAN_ENABLE|Enabled
ScanConvMode|ADC_SCAN_DISABLE|Disabled
ExternalTrigConv|ADC_EXTERNALTRIGCONV_EXT_IT11|EXTI Line11
ExternalTrigConv|ADC_SOFTWARE_START|Regular Conversion launched by software
